<title>USA: U.S. ammonia, DAP prices steady in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. ammonia, DAP prices steady in quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate and ammonia were unchanged on Friday in lackluster trading as fieldwork in the Midwest winds down, U.S. dealers said.</p>
<p>DAP values continued to find support from export purchases by India and China, cash sources said.</p>
<p>		     Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		174-176		 unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  186-189		 unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		170		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
